# Files and folders IBM Bob must not read (Story 1.1, AC 9). Same list as governance/duo-context-exclusions.txt.
# A direct @ mention of a file bypasses this list, so never mention these files in a prompt.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/.env
**/*secret*
**/*password*
**/*credential*
**/racf/**
**/prod-data/**
**/data-extracts/**
**/*.dump
restricted/**
